# GitLab reads this from the repository root. It is a routing table, not a
# gate: it decides who gets asked for review, and (with "Require approval from
# code owners" enabled on the protected branch) whose approval a merge request
# needs.
#
# Everything currently routes to the maintainer. As soon as a second person is
# involved, split the sections below rather than adding them everywhere -- the
# point of this file is that the person who knows an area sees changes to it.

